{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.poster.avif?t=1759786307\" width=698 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.webm?t=1759786307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.mp4?t=1759786307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 8-bitBot you control one to three bots by programming them using very simple instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/95325587bc1acdb65011bb678dba5637.avif?t=1759786307\" width=302 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about having fun finding solutions to simple and complex problems using principles of programming and watching how programs play out:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/56e882972f4f125f86fe8c9912954183.poster.avif?t=1759786307\" width=698 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/56e882972f4f125f86fe8c9912954183.webm?t=1759786307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to the name, 8-bitBot has hardware requirements that feel like a blast from a past: The whole game requires only a few megabytes of disk space and less than 100MB of RAM to run.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959370?t=1759786307","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959370?t=1759786307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/470bcd875ebfaf80fbbb8f0ba596f25bc63eef4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759786307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/470bcd875ebfaf80fbbb8f0ba596f25bc63eef4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759786307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.poster.avif?t=1759786307\" width=698 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.webm?t=1759786307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/49e21de884c63cb8fc5090a3abf5cf85.mp4?t=1759786307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 8-bitBot you control one to three bots by programming them using very simple instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/95325587bc1acdb65011bb678dba5637.avif?t=1759786307\" width=302 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about having fun finding solutions to simple and complex problems using principles of programming and watching how programs play out:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn